  an EXACT +18.00 ms detection bias (half a 30 fps frame + half a 128-sample envelope window; predicted
  18.00, measured 18.00 sd 0.00) and a 13.5 ms VIDEO reference delay the oracle never measured while
  faithfully correcting the audio one. True offset is ~45-63 ms, audio late. CI now gates the symmetric
